 "library": {
  "title": "Mini bag clip 48 x 12 x 7 mm, rounded, spring ring, snap latch, V tongue seal",
  "description": "Mini one-piece bag clip for crisp, coffee and freezer bags. 40 mm jaws, 48 x 12.5 x 7 mm overall, every edge rounded 0.5 mm. The ring hinge is a spring: the top arm prints 10 degrees open, so it always clamps when shut. A snap latch with a ramped catch lip holds it closed; push the tab to release. A V tongue on the top arm presses the bag into a V groove along the lower arm, sealing the full length. It is printed lying flat on a Prusa with no supports. It is plain literal geometry, not variables, so edit the numbers in the tree to resize. Print in PETG at 0.2 mm with 100% infill.",
  "tags": [
   "bag clip",
   "mini",
   "chip clip",
   "rounded",
   "snap",
   "compliant hinge",
   "Prusa",
   "no supports",
   "pince sac"
  ],
